./agents-results/2026-08-31/problem-intelligence-plane/acceptance/release/runs/A4-post-cursor-topic-20260831/attempts/A4-regression-scope-attempt1-transport.log:7405:      "details": "The first test imports real A and B in separate batches, rewrites A's stored result, observation linkage, evidence, processed fingerprint, seen key, and local digests to B's values, and requires reload failure. The second test rewrites imported A into MANUAL_REVIEW/HIGH_RISK_EVENT, adds a deterministic self-consistent queue item, optionally forges evidence risk flags, recomputes the result digest, and requires reload failure because the original projection has no risk flags. The third changes a cursor-conflict queue entry to a foreign topic, recomputes its deterministic manual_id, and updates the matching manual event; reload fails closed."
