Implement the smallest maintainable red/green repair:
1. Durable atomic file replacement for artifact blob, artifact manifest, and observations manifest: fsync file before replace and fsync immediate parent after replace; clean only unrenamed temp files on failure.
2. Ensure newly created nested directories are durably linked by fsyncing each immediate parent after each mkdir.
